<title>USA: HFS, Merrill Corp in pact.</title>
<headline>HFS, Merrill Corp in pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc and Merrill Corp said Thursday that they have entered into a seven-year alliance establishing Merrill as the preferred national supplier of commercial printing, direct mail, and fulfillment services for HFS.</p>
<p>Merrill said that this is the largest client contract in its history. A company spokesman was not immediately available to elaborate.</p>
</text>
